        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step 12.Calculate plastic load mass factor for the flat slab. See Section 4-30.5 and Figure 4A-6 (+).\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                265,
                1044,
                316
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "formula",
            "block_content": "\\begin{aligned}\\left(\\frac{\\bar{L}}{\\bar{L}L_{1}}\\right)_{i}&=\\left(\\frac{\\bar{L}}{\\bar{L}L_{1}}\\right)_{V_{i}}=\\frac{2}{3}X\\left(\\frac{\\bar{L}L}{2}-X\\right)+\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{\\bar{X}^{2}}{2}\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}(116\\left(\\frac{3(240)}{2}-116\\right)+\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\frac{116^{2}}{2}\\right)\\\\\\left(\\frac{\\bar{L}}{\\bar{L}L_{1}}\\right)_{i}&=\\left(\\frac{\\bar{L}}{\\bar{L}L_{1}}\\right)_{V_{i}}=\\frac{2}{3}C\\left(H-\\frac{C}{2}-X\\right)+\\frac{3}{4}\\left(H-\\frac{C}{2}-X\\right)\\frac{3}{2}C-X\\right)/2\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}(40\\left(240-\\frac{40}{2}-116\\right)+\\frac{3}{4}\\left(240-\\frac{40}{2}-116\\right)\\left(\\frac{3(240)}{2}-40-116\\right)/2\\\\\\left(\\frac{\\bar{L}}{\\bar{L}L_{1}}\\right)_{ii}&=\\left(\\frac{\\bar{L}}{\\bar{L}L_{1}}\\right)_{V_{i}}=\\frac{2}{3}C\\frac{\\left(H-C\\right)}{2}+\\frac{3}{4}(H-C)\\left(\\frac{3\\bar{L}}{2}-C-X\\right)/4\\\\&=\\frac{2}{3}(40)\\frac{240-40}{2}+\\frac{3}{4}(240-40)\\left(\\frac{3(240)}{2}-40-116\\right)/4\\\\\\sum_{i=1}^{N_{i}}\\left(\\frac{\\bar{I}}{\\bar{L}L_{1}}\\right)_{i}&=86558.67in^{2}\\\\A_{i}&=A_{iv}=\\frac{X}{2}\\left(3L-X\\right)=\\frac{116}{2}(3\\times240-116)\\\\A_{ii}&=A_{v}=\\left(H-\\frac{C}{2}-X\\right)\\left(\\frac{3\\bar{L}}{2}+C-X\\right)/2\\\\&=\\left(240-\\frac{40}{2}-116\\right)\\left(\\frac{3(240)}{2}+40-116\\right)/2\\\\A_{iii}&=A_{vi}=\\left(H-C\\right)\\left(\\frac{3\\bar{L}}{2}+C-X\\right)/4\\\\&=\\left(240-40\\right)\\left(\\frac{3(240)}{2}+40-116\\right)/4\\\\\\sum_{i=1}^{N_{i}}A_{i}&=128,000.0in^{2}\\\\K_{LM}&=\\frac{\\sum\\left(\\frac{I}{\\bar{L}L_{i}}\\right)_{i}}{\\sum A_{i}}=\\frac{86558.67}{128,000.0}=0.676\\quad(eq.3-59)\\end{aligned}",
            "block_bbox": [
                277,
                336,
                1102,
                1296
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
